WEBVTT
X-TIMESTAMP-MAP=LOCAL:00:00:00.000,MPEGTS:0

00:00.664 --> 00:03.534 align:center line:79%
President Russell M. Nelson
has taught that if the Lord were

00:03.534 --> 00:05.035 align:center line:81%
speaking to us directly,

00:05.402 --> 00:07.905 align:center line:79%
the first thing He would make
sure we understand is our true

00:07.905 --> 00:12.075 align:center line:79%
identity: we are children of God,
children of the covenant,

00:12.075 --> 00:14.077 align:center line:81%
and disciples of Jesus Christ.

00:15.012 --> 00:18.215 align:center line:79%
Any other designation
will ultimately let us down.

00:19.049 --> 00:21.652 align:center line:79%
I learned this for myself
when my oldest son received his first

00:21.652 --> 00:24.087 align:center line:81%
cell phone. With great excitement,

00:24.087 --> 00:27.891 align:center line:79%
he began entering the names of his family
and friends into his contacts.

00:28.292 --> 00:30.527 align:center line:81%
One day I noticed his mom was calling.

00:31.161 --> 00:34.164 align:center line:81%
On the screen appeared the name “Mother.”

00:35.365 --> 00:37.801 align:center line:81%
That was a sensible and dignified choice.

00:37.801 --> 00:42.072 align:center line:79%
And, I’ll admit, a sign of respect
for the better parent in our home.

00:43.440 --> 00:45.075 align:center line:81%
Naturally, I got curious.

00:45.409 --> 00:46.877 align:center line:81%
What name had he given me?

00:48.512 --> 00:51.014 align:center line:79%
I scrolled through his contacts,
assuming that if

00:51.014 --> 00:54.885 align:center line:81%
Wendi was “Mother,” I must be “Father.”

00:56.053 --> 00:57.054 align:center line:81%
Not there.

00:57.888 --> 00:59.990 align:center line:81%
I searched for “Dad.” Still nothing.

01:00.624 --> 01:03.760 align:center line:81%
My curiosity turned into mild concern.

01:05.429 --> 01:06.964 align:center line:81%
Does he call me “Corey”?

01:07.831 --> 01:13.003 align:center line:79%
No. In a last ditch effort,
I thought, “OK, we’re soccer players—

01:13.203 --> 01:15.005 align:center line:81%
maybe he calls me ‘Pelé.’”

01:16.873 --> 01:19.676 align:center line:81%
Wishful thinking. Finally,

01:19.676 --> 01:23.647 align:center line:79%
I called his number myself and two
words popped up on his screen:

01:24.147 --> 01:25.482 align:center line:81%
“Not Mother”!

01:26.016 --> 01:28.118 align:center line:81%
[Laughter]

01:33.690 --> 01:34.992 align:center line:81%
Brothers and sisters.

01:36.326 --> 01:39.229 align:center line:81%
By which name are you called?

01:40.931 --> 01:46.970 align:center line:79%
Jesus called His followers by
many names: disciples, sons and daughters,

01:47.304 --> 01:53.677 align:center line:79%
children of the prophets,
sheep, friends, the light of the world,

01:54.111 --> 01:57.681 align:center line:81%
Saints. Each carries eternal significance

01:57.681 --> 02:01.385 align:center line:79%
and underscores a personal
relationship with the Savior.

02:02.386 --> 02:06.189 align:center line:79%
But among these names,
one rises above the rest:

02:06.723 --> 02:10.594 align:center line:79%
the name of Christ.
In the Book of Mormon,

02:10.594 --> 02:14.731 align:center line:79%
King Benjamin powerfully
taught: “There is no other name given

02:14.731 --> 02:16.400 align:center line:81%
whereby salvation cometh;

02:16.566 --> 02:20.871 align:center line:79%
therefore I would that ye
should take upon you the name of Christ,

02:21.405 --> 02:22.639 align:center line:81%
... and it shall come to pass,

02:22.639 --> 02:26.710 align:center line:79%
that whosoever doeth this shall be found
at the right hand of God,

02:27.110 --> 02:30.080 align:center line:79%
for he shall know the name
by which he is called;

02:30.247 --> 02:34.418 align:center line:79%
for he shall be called
by the name of Christ.”

02:35.719 --> 02:38.388 align:center line:79%
Those who take upon
themselves the name of Christ become

02:38.388 --> 02:40.223 align:center line:81%
His disciples and witnesses.

02:40.724 --> 02:44.594 align:center line:79%
In the book of Acts, we read that after
the Resurrection of Jesus Christ,

02:44.761 --> 02:48.899 align:center line:79%
chosen witnesses were commanded
to testify that whosoever believed

02:48.899 --> 02:51.835 align:center line:81%
in Jesus, was baptized, and received

02:51.835 --> 02:55.806 align:center line:79%
the Holy Ghost would receive
a remission of sins.

02:57.274 --> 02:59.910 align:center line:79%
Those who receive these sacred
ordinances assembled

02:59.910 --> 03:04.581 align:center line:79%
with the Church, became
disciples, and were called Christians.

03:05.682 --> 03:10.020 align:center line:79%
The Book of Mormon also describes
believers in Christ as Christians

03:10.353 --> 03:17.194 align:center line:79%
and covenant people as “the children
of Christ, his sons, and his daughters.”

03:18.195 --> 03:21.064 align:center line:79%
What does it mean to be called
by the name of Christ?

03:21.231 --> 03:25.402 align:center line:79%
It means making and keeping covenants,
always remembering Him,

03:25.535 --> 03:27.204 align:center line:81%
keeping His commandments, and

03:27.204 --> 03:32.843 align:center line:79%
“being willing ... to stand as witnesses
of God at all times and in all things.”

03:33.276 --> 03:35.112 align:center line:81%
It means standing with prophets

03:35.112 --> 03:37.547 align:center line:79%
and apostles as they
carry Christ’s message

03:37.547 --> 03:40.016 align:center line:81%
across the world—with its doctrine,

03:40.016 --> 03:42.119 align:center line:81%
covenants, and ordinances.

03:43.186 --> 03:48.458 align:center line:79%
It also means serving others
to relieve suffering, to be a light,

03:48.792 --> 03:52.395 align:center line:81%
and to bring hope in Christ to all people.

03:53.363 --> 03:56.233 align:center line:81%
Of course, this is a lifelong pursuit.

03:57.100 --> 04:01.037 align:center line:79%
The Prophet Joseph Smith
taught that “this is a station to

04:01.071 --> 04:05.709 align:center line:81%
which no man ever arrived in a moment.”

04:06.843 --> 04:11.615 align:center line:79%
Because the journey of discipleship takes
time and effort built “line upon line,

04:11.681 --> 04:13.316 align:center line:81%
precept upon precept,”

04:13.483 --> 04:16.686 align:center line:79%
it’s easy to get caught up
in worldly titles.

04:17.387 --> 04:22.793 align:center line:79%
These only yield temporary value
and will never be enough on their own.

04:23.593 --> 04:28.064 align:center line:79%
Redemption and the things
of eternity only “cometh in

04:28.064 --> 04:30.233 align:center line:81%
and through the Holy Messiah.”

04:31.301 --> 04:34.504 align:center line:81%
Therefore, following prophetic counsel

04:34.704 --> 04:39.276 align:center line:79%
to make discipleship
a priority is both timely and wise,

04:39.709 --> 04:44.381 align:center line:79%
especially in an age of so
many competing voices and influences.

04:45.182 --> 04:49.352 align:center line:79%
This was at the heart of King Benjamin’s
counsel when he said, “I would

04:49.352 --> 04:52.088 align:center line:79%
that ye should remember
to retain the name of Christ

04:52.088 --> 04:54.491 align:center line:81%
written always in your hearts, ...

04:54.491 --> 05:00.463 align:center line:79%
that ye hear and know the voice
by which ye shall be called,

05:00.463 --> 05:05.235 align:center line:79%
and also, the name by
which he shall call you.”

05:06.303 --> 05:08.104 align:center line:81%
I've seen this in my own family.

05:08.672 --> 05:10.807 align:center line:81%
My great-grandfather, Martin Gossner,

05:11.074 --> 05:14.411 align:center line:79%
was changed forever because a humble
branch president answered

05:14.411 --> 05:19.916 align:center line:79%
the Savior’s call. In Germany in 1909,
times were tough and money was tight.

05:20.217 --> 05:23.286 align:center line:79%
Martin worked as a welder
in a pipe manufacturing plant.

05:23.653 --> 05:26.756 align:center line:79%
By his own admission,
most paydays ended in drinking,

05:26.756 --> 05:29.192 align:center line:81%
smoking, and buying rounds at the pub.

05:30.026 --> 05:34.364 align:center line:79%
His wife finally warned him that if
he didn't change, she would leave.

05:35.465 --> 05:38.501 align:center line:79%
One day, Martin's coworker met him
on the way to the pub

05:38.501 --> 05:41.004 align:center line:79%
with a crumpled
religious booklet in his hand.

05:41.504 --> 05:44.307 align:center line:79%
He had found it on the street and told
Martin that he felt something different

05:44.307 --> 05:49.446 align:center line:79%
after reading the pamphlet entitled
“Was wissen Sie von den Mormonen?”

05:50.247 --> 05:52.749 align:center line:81%
or “What do you know about the Mormons?”

05:53.850 --> 05:56.052 align:center line:81%
I'm certain that title has changed.

05:58.355 --> 06:01.324 align:center line:79%
An address stamped
on the back was just legible enough

06:01.324 --> 06:03.627 align:center line:81%
to decipher where the Church was located.

06:04.127 --> 06:05.929 align:center line:81%
It was a considerable distance away,

06:05.929 --> 06:08.932 align:center line:79%
but they were moved by what
they read and decided to take the train

06:08.932 --> 06:10.533 align:center line:81%
that Sunday to investigate.

06:11.101 --> 06:14.604 align:center line:79%
When they arrived, they found
that the address was not the church

06:14.604 --> 06:16.873 align:center line:81%
they expected, but a funeral home.

06:17.774 --> 06:20.377 align:center line:81%
Martin hesitated—because really,

06:20.977 --> 06:25.548 align:center line:79%
a church in a funeral home sounded
a little too much like a package deal.

06:28.184 --> 06:32.689 align:center line:79%
But upstairs, in a rented hall,
they found a small group of Saints.

06:33.089 --> 06:35.458 align:center line:81%
A man invited them to a testimony meeting.

06:35.625 --> 06:38.995 align:center line:79%
Martin was touched by the Spirit
and so impressed by the simple,

06:38.995 --> 06:42.666 align:center line:79%
fervent testimonies
that he bore his testimony.

06:43.733 --> 06:48.838 align:center line:79%
And it was there, in that most
unlikely place that he said he already

06:48.838 --> 06:50.874 align:center line:81%
knew it must be true.

06:52.042 --> 06:55.412 align:center line:79%
Afterward, the man introduced
himself as the branch president

06:55.412 --> 06:57.180 align:center line:81%
and asked if they would return.

06:57.647 --> 07:00.116 align:center line:79%
Martin explained that he lived
too far away and couldn't

07:00.116 --> 07:02.319 align:center line:81%
afford the weekly trip.

07:02.719 --> 07:05.455 align:center line:79%
The branch president
simply said, “Follow me.”

07:06.222 --> 07:09.492 align:center line:79%
They walked a few blocks to a nearby
factory where the branch

07:09.492 --> 07:10.927 align:center line:81%
president's friend worked.

07:10.927 --> 07:15.065 align:center line:79%
After a short conversation, Martin
and his friend were both offered jobs.

07:15.465 --> 07:18.601 align:center line:79%
Then the branch president led
them to an apartment building

07:18.601 --> 07:20.937 align:center line:81%
and secured housing for their families.

07:21.738 --> 07:24.140 align:center line:81%
All of this happened within two hours.

07:25.208 --> 07:27.811 align:center line:81%
Martin's family moved the following week.

07:28.178 --> 07:30.280 align:center line:81%
Six months later, they were baptized.

07:30.814 --> 07:33.049 align:center line:81%
The man once known as a hopeless drunk,

07:33.249 --> 07:37.721 align:center line:79%
became so ardent in his new faith
that people in town began calling him,

07:37.954 --> 07:41.324 align:center line:79%
perhaps not so affectionately,
“the priest.”

07:42.759 --> 07:46.162 align:center line:79%
As for the branch president,
I cannot tell you his name.

07:46.563 --> 07:48.598 align:center line:81%
His identity has been lost to time.

07:49.165 --> 07:56.373 align:center line:79%
But I call him a disciple, ambassador,
Christian, Good Samaritan, and friend.

07:56.973 --> 08:01.244 align:center line:79%
His influence is still
felt 116 years later,

08:01.644 --> 08:05.081 align:center line:79%
and I stand on the shoulders
of his discipleship.

08:06.116 --> 08:09.085 align:center line:79%
There is a saying that you
can count the seeds in an apple,

08:09.085 --> 08:12.055 align:center line:79%
but you can't count the apples
that come from one seed.

08:12.455 --> 08:16.459 align:center line:79%
The seed planted by the branch
president has produced countless fruit.

08:16.960 --> 08:20.296 align:center line:79%
Little would he have known
that 48 years later,

08:20.397 --> 08:23.366 align:center line:79%
several generations
of Martin's family on both sides

08:23.366 --> 08:26.870 align:center line:79%
of the veil would be sealed
in the Bern Switzerland temple.

08:28.204 --> 08:31.307 align:center line:79%
Perhaps the greatest
sermons are the ones we never hear,

08:31.307 --> 08:33.109 align:center line:81%
but those we see in the quiet,

08:33.176 --> 08:37.013 align:center line:79%
unassuming actions and deeds observed
in the lives of ordinary people

08:37.047 --> 08:39.849 align:center line:81%
who,  trying to be like Jesus,

08:40.517 --> 08:44.654 align:center line:79%
go about doing good.
What this gracious branch president

08:44.654 --> 08:46.489 align:center line:81%
did was not part of a checklist.

08:46.689 --> 08:50.627 align:center line:79%
He was simply living the gospel
as described in the Book of Alma:

08:51.594 --> 08:54.864 align:center line:79%
“They did not send
any away ... that were hungry,

08:55.165 --> 08:57.801 align:center line:81%
or that were athirst, or that were sick.

08:58.168 --> 09:02.505 align:center line:79%
... They were liberal to all, both
old and young, ... both male and female.”

09:03.306 --> 09:06.576 align:center line:81%
And a point we should not overlook,

09:07.577 --> 09:12.849 align:center line:79%
they did not send away any, “whether out
of the church or in the church.”

09:14.751 --> 09:18.054 align:center line:79%
Those who take upon themselves the name
of Christ recognize,

09:18.054 --> 09:19.355 align:center line:81%
as Joseph Smith said,

09:19.789 --> 09:22.192 align:center line:79%
“A man filled with the love
of God is not content

09:22.192 --> 09:25.962 align:center line:79%
with blessing his family alone,
but ranges through the whole world anxious

09:25.962 --> 09:28.431 align:center line:81%
to bless the whole human race.”

09:29.232 --> 09:31.601 align:center line:81%
This is how Jesus lived.

09:31.768 --> 09:35.805 align:center line:79%
In fact, He did so much that His disciples
couldn’t write it all down.

09:36.306 --> 09:37.907 align:center line:81%
The Apostle John recorded:

09:38.174 --> 09:41.478 align:center line:79%
“There are also many other
things which Jesus did, the which,

09:41.478 --> 09:43.746 align:center line:81%
if they should be written every one,

09:43.746 --> 09:47.283 align:center line:79%
I suppose that even the world
itself could not contain the books

09:47.283 --> 09:48.451 align:center line:81%
that should be written.”

09:49.452 --> 09:51.554 align:center line:81%
Let us strive to follow Christ's example,

09:51.554 --> 09:55.425 align:center line:79%
doing good and making
discipleship a lifelong priority,

09:55.425 --> 09:57.794 align:center line:81%
so that each time we interact with others,

09:57.794 --> 10:04.067 align:center line:79%
they will feel God's love and the
confirming power of the Holy Ghost.

10:04.634 --> 10:08.805 align:center line:79%
Then we may join my great grandfather
and millions of others who have declared,

10:08.905 --> 10:13.176 align:center line:79%
like the disciple Andrew,
“We have found the Messias.”

10:14.110 --> 10:17.914 align:center line:79%
In the end, our identity
isn't defined by the world,

10:18.081 --> 10:23.119 align:center line:79%
but our discipleship is defined
by the ordinances we receive,

10:23.153 --> 10:24.420 align:center line:81%
the covenants we keep,

10:24.554 --> 10:28.024 align:center line:79%
and the love we show to God
and neighbor by simply doing good.

10:28.525 --> 10:31.995 align:center line:79%
As President Nelson taught,
we are indeed children of God,

10:32.195 --> 10:35.632 align:center line:79%
children of the covenant,
disciples of Jesus Christ.

10:35.865 --> 10:38.902 align:center line:79%
I testify that Jesus Christ
lives and has redeemed us.

10:39.002 --> 10:42.272 align:center line:79%
He is the one who said,
“I have called thee by thy name;

10:42.605 --> 10:47.076 align:center line:79%
thou art mine.” In the name
of Jesus Christ, amen.

